        // (1,000 / 1,489 = 0.67159) = 102,135.8, so 102,000 RUB/kW x 300,000
        // kW = 30,600,000,000 (P7-IPS-008, a 2019 bid, is dated and a
        // cross-check only). Fixed O&M (ruling 4, authoring judgment: derived
        // from [P7-IPS-007] by NA kind relativity): 102,135.83 x NA fixed O&M
        // / capital (20.0 / 1,000 = 0.02) = 2,042.7, so 2,040 x 300,000 / 12
